+# Billing disputes
+
+Billing support uses `classifyBillingQuestion` in `/src/billing.ts` to distinguish
+refund and invoice questions:
+
+- A message containing the exact lowercase text `refund` is classified as
+  `refund-review`.
+- Every other billing message, including an invoice question, is classified as
+  `invoice-question`.
+
+This classification selects only the question category. It does not establish refund
+eligibility, invoice correctness, account facts, or authority to make billing changes.
+Support responses must stay within available project evidence and must not invent or
+promise those outcomes.

